note: dropping probes 22-25 and 28-29 (the C12 slots) on wormhole.
  They stall on STALLWAIT condition C12, "Any thread has an instruction in
  any stage of the Configuration Unit pipeline", which only BlackholeA0
  defines. Wormhole's fifteen condition bits name no unit RDCFG runs on --
  and do not need to: WormholeB0/RDCFG.md blocks the issuing thread for the
  whole instruction, so there the documented ">= 2" is an occupancy and
  probe 14 already measures it.
